Disable filesystem ACL support absent from the native provider contract.

The SDK's cross-compile probes report richacl functions as available without
linking them, leaving RICHACL_LIBRARY-NOTFOUND in archive_static's link list.
Kodi supplies archive input through VFS callbacks; filesystem ACL APIs are
not needed to read archive contents.

Upstream: PS5-only dependency configuration.

